    "That conversation is no longer available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段对话已不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That request wasn't understood. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没能理解这次请求，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Leader takes on your requests, hands parts to your other Bots, manages them and brings back one answer. One Bot leads at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "负责人接下你的需求，拆分后分派给你的其他 Bot 并管理它们，最后汇总成一个答复。同一时间只有一个 Bot 担任负责人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent is still building this plan — steps, cost and risk arrive before it can be approved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 仍在生成方案——步骤、费用和风险就绪后才能批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app registration needs a federated credential for this team before it can be bound.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该应用注册需要先为本团队配置联合 Credential，才能绑定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code expires in 10 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证码 10 分钟内有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection went quiet for too long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接长时间没有响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation owner can choose credentials for this conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话所有者可以为这段对话选择 Credential。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation stays here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话保留在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan is kept for reference but will no longer be run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "方案会保留供查阅，但不再执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prompt sets the writing style and spells names Whisper doesn't know, such as products and services. Recordings are transcribed by OpenAI Whisper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示词用于设定写作风格，并拼出 Whisper 不认识的名称，例如产品和服务名。录音由 OpenAI Whisper 转写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording couldn't be transcribed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段录音无法转写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The role must already trust the Nuphos connector — Nuphos assumes it before saving the binding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该角色必须已信任 Nuphos Connector——保存绑定前 Nuphos 会先代入该角色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime went quiet; the reply was closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runtime 长时间没有响应，这条回复已结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server opened an unexpected stream (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器返回了意外的数据流（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Them, %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方，%1$@：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Them: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Bot hands work to its owner's other Bots and manages them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Bot 负责给主人的其他 Bot 分派工作并管理它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the runtime's files and sign-in and starts a fresh one in a moment. Your agents' history stays in Yu AI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除该 Runtime 的文件和登录状态，稍后自动换上一个全新的 Runtime。你的 Agent 历史仍保留在 Yu AI 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device signed in before device management existed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备在设备管理上线前就已登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This disconnects the runtime. Your agents stay in Yu AI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会断开该 Runtime 的连接。你的 Agent 仍保留在 Yu AI 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This runtime runs on your computer. After the move, people in this conversation can reply only if they can use this computer; the others can still read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Runtime 在你的电脑上。移动后，这段对话里的人必须能使用这台电脑才能回复，其他人仍可阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This submits a deletion request; it does not instantly erase your account. You can continue using your account while the request is processed. Signing in again does not cancel the request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会提交删除申请，不会立刻清空账户。处理期间你仍可使用账户。再次登录不会取消该申请。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
