    "Waiting on a newer request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待更新的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We will permanently delete your account and associated personal data within 30 days. Our team will coordinate any workspace ownership and shared-data handling. Records required by law and data jointly held by your team may be retained where necessary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们会在 30 天内永久删除你的账户及相关个人数据。Workspace 归属和共享数据的处理由我们协调。法律要求保留的记录和由团队共同持有的数据，在必要时会继续保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Nuphos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Yu Bot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Yu Bot": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Yu Bot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should change?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要修改什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent needs you to decide something, it shows up here. Answer it and it leaves the Inbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 需要你决定时，会出现在这里。答复后就会从 Inbox 消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your account is signed in. Sign out anything you don’t recognize, then change your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里是账户的登录位置。发现不认识的设备，先退出登录，再修改密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who receives this data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "谁会收到这些数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdraw": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤回"
