      }
    },
    "You can't chat with Bots until you allow it again, and unsent drafts are deleted. Work already running is not stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新授权之前不能和 Bot 对话，没发出去的草稿会被删掉。已经在跑的工作不会停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have permission to do that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你没有权限执行此操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll sign in with your own %@ account. Your plan's usage limits apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将使用你自己的 %@ 账户登录，并适用你所购套餐的用量限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
